{"text":"大魏孝昌三年歲次丁未，五月廿日，比丘尼法恩仰爲七世父母、所生父母、□養因緣眷屬造釋迦文佛一區。原生生世世値佛聞法，願願從心。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"法恩","refId":null,"text":"法恩","start":19,"end":21},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"因緣","refId":null,"text":"因緣","start":35,"end":37},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"釋迦","refId":null,"text":"釋迦","start":40,"end":42},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"聞法","refId":null,"text":"聞法","start":54,"end":56}]}